      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated and consistent walking staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently commend the reliability, punctuality, and warmth of the dog walkers and pet sitters. Clients appreciate having assigned walkers such as Logan, James, Jack, Corbin, and Gift, which helps pets build long-term trust. Reviewers also express appreciation for the company employing insured W-2 staff, noting that low staff turnover ensures steady care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Detailed daily updates and photographs"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently highlight the comprehensive updates sent after each walk and check-in visit. Clients love receiving photos, GPS route maps, and notes detailing potty breaks and water refills directly through the mobile app. Pet parents also mention that the office management team responds quickly to scheduling changes and inquiries."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive care for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients emphasize that walkers and sitters treat their pets with genuine care, affection, and patience. In addition to daily dog walks, reviewers praise in-home sitting for older cats and young kittens while owners travel. Pet owners note feeling complete peace of mind knowing their animals remain relaxed, safe, and well-cared for at home."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
